    "definitions": {
      "short": "an untruth ; by implication, a sham (often adverbial)",
      "usage": "without a cause, deceit(-ful), false(-hood, -ly), feignedly, liar, lie, lying, vain (thing), wrongfully.",
      "full": "H8267. sheqer שֶׁ֫קֶר 113 noun masculine deception, disappointment, falsehood ; — ׳שׁ Exod 23:7 64t.; שָׁ֑קֶר 5:9 42t.; plural שְׁקָרִים Psa 101:7 3 t.; suffix שִׁקְרֵיהֶם Jer 23:22 ; &#8212; 1 deception , what deceives, disappoints, and betrays one : a molten image Jer 10:14 = 51:17 ; gift Prov 25:14 ; grace of person 31:30 , etc.; שׁ ׳אֹ֫רַח Psa 119:104 ; 119:128 ; שׁ ׳דֶּ֫רֶח 119:29 ; בשׁ ׳בטח Jer 13:25 ; שׁ ׳נחל 16:19 , compare also Psa 7:15 ; 33:17 ; 119:118 ; Isa 28:15 ; לַשֶּׁקֶר for disappointment, in vain 1Sam 25:21 ; Jer 3:23 . 2 deceit, fraud, wrong : שׁ (ל) ׳עשׂה do or practise fraud, wrong Hosea 7:1 ; Jer 6:13 ; 8:8 , 10 ; with בְ , 2Sam 18:13 ; שׁ ׳מְּעֻלַּת Prov 11:18 ; שׁ ׳לֶ֫חֶם 20:17 food got by fraud ; שׁ ׳זֶ֫רע Isa 57:4 ; שׁ ׳עֵט Jer 8:8 ; שׁ ׳ילד Psa 7:15 (|| עמל ); שׁ קשׁת לשׁון ׳דרךְ Jer 9:2 ; ׳בְּשׁ 3:10 (|| בגד ), adverb שׁקד fraudulently, wrongfully Psa 35:19 ; 38:20 ; 69:5 ; 119:78 ; 119:86 . 3 injurious falsehood , in testimony, especially in courts : שֶׁקֶר עַד Exod 20:16 (E) Deut 19:18 ; Psa 27:12 ; Prov 6:19 ; 14:5 ; 25:18 ; שׁקרים עֵד 12:17 ; 19:5 , 9 ; שׁ ׳ענה Deut 19:18 testify falsehood ; שׁ ׳שְׁבֻעַת Ze 8:17 false oath ; לשׁ ׳נשׁבע swear falsely Jer 5:2 5 t.; שׁ על ׳נשׁבע Leviticus 5:22; שׁ ׳דבּר Micah 6:12 + (see [ דָּבַר ], דָּבָר ); שׁ י ׳אִמְרֵ Isa 32:7 ; שׁ ׳שׂפת(י) Psa 31:19 ; 120:2 ; Prov 10:18 ; 17:7 ; ׳שׁ טפל Job 13:4 ; Psa 119:69 , compare 119:163 ; absolute false ! 2Kin 9:12 ; Jer 37:14 . 4 falsity , of false or self-deceived prophets: שׁ ׳נכּא prophesy falsely Jer 14:14 ; 23:25-26 , 29:21 ; + ל person 27:10 ; 20:14 , 16 ; ׳נ ׳לַשּׁ 20:15 ; ׳נ ׳בשׁ 5:31 ; 20:6 ; 29:9 ; שׁ ׳מוֺרֶה Isa 9:14 ; Hab 2:18 ; שׁ ׳חזה Zech 10:2 ; שׁ ׳חֲזוֺן Jer 14:14 , etc., (+ 12 t.); שׁ ׳רוּח . 5 lie, falsehood , in General: שׁ ׳דבר Psa 101:7 (|| רְמִיָּה ); שׁ ׳דְּבַר Prov 13:5 ; of מִלִּים Job 36:4 ; שׁ ׳לְשׁוֺן false tongue Prov 6:17 ; 12:19 ; 21:6 ; 26:28 ; Psa 109:2 ; of lips Prov 12:22 ; שׁ ׳אִישׁ 17:4 liar .",
